    {
      "id": "claim_455b031302cc4530a8c5931bd326a6fd",
      "statement": "The three runtime dependencies are Pillow (image opening/rotation/saving), exifread (reading EXIF DateTimeOriginal), and piexif (writing the RelativePath EXIF tag); the tool requires Python 3.x and the CI image uses python:3.12-slim.",
